# Live message bus contents are local state, not tooling.
# Schemas (messages/types/) and the README stay tracked.
# In transport=git mode, messages are tracked on the backbone branch or shared repo instead (see spec v5).
messages/*
!messages/README.md
!messages/types/

# Per-machine transport setting (see docs/git-transport.md).
backbone.config
.claude/handoffs/*

# Per-machine ping log (see docs/notify.md).
.claude/data/backbone/
